WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the supplied safe demo. It deliberately requests a missing file and returns a 404, so no account, project, or real customer data is needed.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Select the failing button, then record the interaction once. ReproLens connects your click to the page handler and identifies the exact request that failed.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
The explanation tells you what the error means and suggests the first useful debugging check. Direct browser evidence stays separate from events observed afterward.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Finally, review the locally redacted bug report before sharing anything, and download a Playwright test starting point. Traces stay on your device unless you export them.
